# Paste your Gemini API key after the = sign. Get one free at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# If you have more keys, paste them on the next lines. When a key runs out of free quota,
# the tool moves to the next key by itself. Add as many lines as you like
# (any name that starts with GEMINI_API_KEY works: GEMINI_API_KEY_4=, GEMINI_API_KEY_5= ...).
# Tip: make each key in a different Google Cloud project. Keys in the same project share one quota.

GEMINI_API_KEY_1=
GEMINI_API_KEY_2=
GEMINI_API_KEY_3=
